{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06060","headline":"达奚侍郎夫人寇氏挽词二首 二 · 王维","name":"达奚侍郎夫人寇氏挽词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"女史悲彤管，夫人罢锦轩。\n卜茔占二室，行哭度千门。\n秋日光能淡，寒川波自翻。\n一朝成万古，松柏暗平原。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}